      "message": "docs(openspec): propose add-wc-editor-element change\n\nProposal, design, spec deltas and task list for the <nexus-editor>\nWeb Component wrapper (ROADMAP #22). Re-lands the capability attempted\nin PR #49 with the review findings addressed; validated with\nopenspec validate --strict.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
