    {
      "sha": "b857449e8ff53728efaa64ff06a1a4978952b115",
      "message": "feat(wc): add <nexus-editor> custom element wrapper\n\nNew @floatboat/nexus-wc package implementing OpenSpec\nadd-wc-editor-element: light-DOM custom element with scalar config via\nobserved attributes, rich config via properties (property wins),\ncontrolled-document value sync mirroring the React/Vue helpers,\nmicrotask-coalesced editor rebuild for post-mount config changes\n(preserves document/selection/focus, re-emits nexus-ready), deferred\ndestroy so same-task reparenting keeps the live editor, and composed\nbubbling nexus-* events.\n\nWorkspace wiring: tsconfig.base path, vitest alias, root build script\nordered after core, lockfile importer, wc commit scope, ROADMAP #22 →\nin-progress, Web Component quick-start in both READMEs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "date": "2026-07-02T07:36:40Z"
    }
